---
title: ":bread: Grilled Ranch Bread"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 8
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 5 minutes
total time: 10 minutes
tags:
  - breads
  - ranch
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

In a #small bowl{}, combine softened @butter{1/2%cup} with @ranch salad dressing mix{1%packet}.

Slice @French bread loaves{2} lengthwise and spread tops with the butter mixture.

Place bread under the #broiler{} until crispy and golden brown, about 3 to ~{5%minutes}.
